iability</a>&nbsp;    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/general-conditions-of-carriage\">General conditions of carriage and Tariffs</a>&nbsp;    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/rules-and-regulations-governing-carriage-by-air\">Rules and regulations governing carriage by Air</a>&nbsp;    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/web-check-in-terms-and-conditions\">Web Check-in terms and conditions</a>&nbsp;    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/my-upgrade\">My Upgrade terms and conditions</a>&nbsp;    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a class=\"saudia-link\" href=\"https://www.saudia.com/help/useful-links/legal-and-terms-and-conditions/hajj-and-umrah-travel-conditions\">Hajj, Umrah and Tourist travel conditions</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/customer-service-plan\">Customer service plan</a>&nbsp;    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/tarmac-delay-contingency-plan\">Tarmac delay contingency plan</a>&nbsp;    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/book/travel-information/branded-fares\">Baggage Allowances&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;   </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/seats-reservation\">Seats Reservation Service</a>&nbsp;    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a class=\"saudia-link\" href=\"https://gaca.gov.sa/-/media/Files/PDF/LawsAndRegulation/Consumer-Protection/Passernger-Rights-Regulations.pdf\">Passenger Rights Protection Regulations</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a>&nbsp;    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/data-protection-policy\">Data Protection Policy</a>&nbsp;    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/terms-of-use\">Terms of use</a>&nbsp;    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/cookie-policy\">Cookie Policy</a>&nbsp;    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/fare-ancillary-conditions\">Fare and Ancillary Conditions</a>&nbsp;    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/alfursan\">AlFursan terms and conditions</a>&nbsp;    </li>\n    <li class=\"saudia-links-item\">\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/flight-pass-terms-and-conditions\">Saudia Flight Pass Terms and Conditions</a>&nbsp;        </li>\n</ul>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></